### Import API - Test Requests
### Use con REST Client extension (VS Code) o Postman
### Reemplaza <token> con JWT válido y <companyId> con ID real

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = Bearer <token>
@companyId = 1
@sessionId = upload_1721302345678_a1b2c3d4e

###
### 1. Upload de Archivo
### Requiere archivo real en la ruta indicada
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/upload
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="balance_2025.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./test-data/balance_2025.xlsx
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="importType"

BALANCE
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ejercicio"

2025
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sheetName"

Balance
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###
### 2. Sugerir Mapeos de Columnas
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/suggest-mapping
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "columnMappings": {
    "Código": null,
    "Nombre": "cuentaNombre",
    "Debe": "debe",
    "Haber": "haber"
  }
}

###
### 3. Validar Datos (sin importar)
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/validate
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "importType": "BALANCE",
  "ejercicio": 2025,
  "columnMappings": {
    "Código": "cuentaCodigo",
    "Nombre": "cuentaNombre",
    "Debe": "debe",
    "Haber": "haber"
  },
  "manualAccountMappings": {
    "1000": "100000",
    "5000": "500000"
  },
  "sheetName": "Balance"
}

###
### 4. Confirmar e Importar
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/confirm
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "importType": "BALANCE",
  "ejercicio": 2025,
  "columnMappings": {
    "Código": "cuentaCodigo",
    "Nombre": "cuentaNombre",
    "Debe": "debe",
    "Haber": "haber"
  },
  "manualAccountMappings": {
    "1000": "100000",
    "1200": "120000",
    "1300": "130000",
    "1400": "140000",
    "2100": "210000",
    "2200": "220000",
    "3000": "300000",
    "4000": "400000",
    "5000": "500000"
  }
}

###
### 5. Obtener Estado
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/status
Authorization: {{token}}

###
### 6. Obtener Progreso
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/progress
Authorization: {{token}}

###
### 7. Obtener Asiento de Apertura (formato JSON)
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/opening-entry
Authorization: {{token}}

###
### 8. Obtener Asiento de Apertura (formato CSV)
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/opening-entry?format=csv
Authorization: {{token}}

###
### 9. Cancelar Importación
###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/cancel
Authorization: {{token}}

###
### EJEMPLO COMPLETO: Flujo de 4 pasos
###

### Paso 1: Upload (genera sessionId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/upload
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="balance.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./test-data/balance_2025.xlsx
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="importType"

BALANCE
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ejercicio"

2025
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Paso 2: Validate (usa sessionId del paso 1)
# Copiar sessionId de la respuesta anterior y reemplazar en @sessionId
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/validate
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "importType": "BALANCE",
  "ejercicio": 2025,
  "columnMappings": {
    "Código": "cuentaCodigo",
    "Nombre": "cuentaNombre",
    "Debe": "debe",
    "Haber": "haber"
  }
}

### Paso 3: Confirm (una vez validado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/confirm
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "importType": "BALANCE",
  "ejercicio": 2025,
  "columnMappings": {
    "Código": "cuentaCodigo",
    "Nombre": "cuentaNombre",
    "Debe": "debe",
    "Haber": "haber"
  }
}

### Paso 4: Obtener resultado
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/status
Authorization: {{token}}

###
### TESTS ADICIONALES
###

### Test: Upload sin autenticación (debe fallar con 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.xlsx"

<test
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Test: Sesión no encontrada (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/nonexistent_session_id/status
Authorization: {{token}}

### Test: Validar sin sesión (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/invalid_session/validate
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "importType": "BALANCE",
  "ejercicio": 2025,
  "columnMappings": {}
}

### Test: Archivo inválido - formato no soportado
# Intenta subir un archivo .txt o similar
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/upload
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invalid.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Contenido inválido
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="importType"

BALANCE
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ejercicio"

2025
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Test: Cancelar importación
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/import/{{sessionId}}/cancel
Authorization: {{token}}
